:::text id=u5A1ZIW3mh at=top-center width=86% height=144 offsetY=80 preset=title align=left
# A small story
:::

:::text id=Xp1IENk0yN at=center-left width=24% height=64 offsetX=80 offsetY=-40 preset=caption align=left color=muted
SETUP
:::

:::text id=FTpTVhFqCy x=160 y=352 w=304 h=120 preset=body align=left
We had a backlog of 200 bugs and only three engineers.
:::

:::text id=sZxAVv62Qb at=center width=24% height=64 offsetY=-40 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
TURN
:::

:::text id=pvSgXkbppB x=488 y=352 w=304 h=168 preset=body align=left
We stopped fixing bugs for a week and rewrote the underlying API.
:::

:::text id=pFyuKKbm4T at=center-right width=24% height=64 offsetX=-80 offsetY=-40 preset=caption align=left color=#22C55E
PAYOFF
:::

:::text id=zqagBdDkQq x=816 y=360 w=304 h=160 preset=body align=left
Half the bugs disappeared. The rest got easier.
:::
